---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Warren"
  description="Warren is a developer in Vancouver making games, study software, desktop utilities, and other personal tools."
  pageClass="inner-page"
>
  <header class="page-hero page-hero--about">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>I’m Warren.<br /><em>I build software in Vancouver.</em></h1>
    <p>The short version is that I make the software I want to use, or something specific for a person I know.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="about-intro section-shell">
    <div class="about-intro__copy prose-large">
      <p>
        My projects move between games, study software, desktop utilities, document pipelines,
        and small experiments. The subjects vary because the starting points vary: a game I want
        to play on a portrait monitor, an MCAT app that keeps its data locally, a birthday present
        someone can walk around in, or a clipboard utility that behaves the way I want on my own computer.
      </p>
      <p>
        I care about the part after the prototype: using the thing, finding out where it gets in the
        way, and changing it until it becomes something I keep around.
      </p>
    </div>
    <aside class="about-intro__facts">
      <dl class="status-list">
        <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>{site.location}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Current work</dt><dd>Games, learning software, and local tools</dd></div>
        <div><dt>GitHub</dt><dd><a href={site.githubUrl}>{site.githubLabel}</a></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="about-details section-shell">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Areas in the work</p>
      <ul class="tag-cloud">
        <li>Game systems</li>
        <li>Local-first software</li>
        <li>Learning tools</li>
        <li>Procedural audio</li>
        <li>Desktop utilities</li>
        <li>Interactive chemistry</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="about-details__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Still to add</p>
      <p>
        This page still needs the personal details that cannot be recovered from a repository:
        the interests outside software, the path into development, and the parts of Vancouver
        that should actually appear on the site.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
